	(text "STM32H5 general autopilot for up to 6 motors\n\n\nPower Input: 2s - 6s\nDual BEC with 5V 2A and 5V/6V/9V/10V 2A outputs\nIMU: BMI270 or ICM-42688-P\nBaro: BMP280\nCompass: QMC5883L\n6x UARTs\n1x I2C\nWS2812B LED Strip Output\nMicroSD slot\n7 GPIOs which includes:\n	1x Analog Input\n	2x Extra ESC Outputs\n	1x Timer output\n	3x Regular GPIO "
